{"id":2,"gn":"Pokémon Graine","ft":["Lorsque le bourgeon sur son dos éclot, il répand un doux parfum pour célébrer sa floraison.","Il y a un bulbe sur son dos. On dit que s’il absorbe assez de nutriments, ce bulbe se transforme en une jolie fleur.","Un bourgeon a poussé sur le dos de ce Pokémon. Pour en supporter le poids, Herbizarre a dû se muscler les pattes. Lorsqu’il commence à se prélasser au soleil, ça signifie que son bourgeon va éclore, donnant naissance à une fleur.","En emmagasinant de l’énergie, son bulbe grossit. Un arôme en émane quand il s’apprête à éclore.","Son bulbe dorsal est devenu si gros qu’il ne peut plus se tenir sur ses pattes postérieures.","La lumière du soleil le rend plus fort et vigoureux. Le bulbe sur son dos grossit en conséquence."],"fv":{"17":0,"18":0,"23":1,"24":0,"25":2,"26":2,"31":3,"32":3,"33":4,"34":5},"gr":1,"cr":45,"hc":20,"bh":70,"eg":["Monstrueux","Végétal"],"gw":"medium-slow","gm":{"za":[0,149],"svdisk":[0,165],"sv":[2,165],"swisle":[0,69],"sw":[1,69],"lgpe":[0,2],"xy":[0,81],"hgss":[0,232],"frlg":[0,2],"c":[0,227],"gs":[0,227],"y":[0,2],"rb":[0,2]},"f":{"2":{"n":"Herbizarre","t":["grass","poison"],"s":[60,62,63,80,80,60],"h":1,"w":13,"a":[[65,0],[34,1]],"ps":[[1,[60,62,63,80,80,60]]],"pa":[[4,[[65,0]]]],"av":["za","svdisk","sv","swisle","sw","lgpe","xy","hgss","frlg","c","gs","y","rb"],"ls":[{"l":[[22,1],[33,1],[45,1],[74,1],[73,9],[75,12],[77,15],[79,15],[402,20],[36,25],[230,30],[235,35],[388,40],[438,45],[76,50]],"m":[14,34,36,38,46,76,92,156,164,174,182,188,202,203,204,206,214,241,263,270,282,311,331,345,402,412,437,447,474,491,520,580,803,851,885],"e":[80,92,174,275]},{"l":[[33,1],[45,1],[22,1],[74,1],[73,9],[75,12],[77,15],[79,15],[402,20],[36,25],[230,30],[235,35],[388,40],[38,45],[76,50]],"m":[14,34,76,113,133,156,164,173,182,188,202,203,204,206,213,214,219,241,263,270,311,331,345,402,412,437,438,447,474,496,526,580],"t":[520,803]},{"l":[[33,1],[45,1],[22,1],[73,1],[22,5],[73,9],[77,14],[79,14],[36,22],[75,31],[74,